                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Update:\nTaxi mode is in beta now.\nNew time trials added.\n\nSpontaneous purchase, seen, bought and love it.\nIt has a very nice art style and it runs super smooth.\nYou can feel that the developer loves his game.\n\nThere is a huge map and some modes like Dogfights, Time Trial or Free Play.\nSome parts of the map are not done yet and some modes are not implemented.\nNo problems with Xbox One Controller.\nNext updates already announced.\n\n[table]\n    [tr]\n        [th]Sound[/th]\n        [th]7/10[/th]\n        [td]It's not my style of music and tracks in dogfight ending too early.[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]Graphic[/th]\n        [th]8/10[/th]\n        [td]I like this style. Its beautiful\n[i]Settings:[/i]\n[list] \n    [*]2560x1440p\n    [*]144 Hz G-Sync\n    [*]4XAA \n    [*]Avg. fps 143 fps\n[/list][/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]Gameplay[/th]\n        [th]7/10[/th]\n        [td]Already great. I think after a few updates it will be a must have for this price.\n[/td]\n    [/tr]\n[/table]",
